WEBVTT

00:02.844 --> 00:04.804
- [thunderclap]
- [banner fluttering]

00:04.846 --> 00:07.222
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:09.141 --> 00:10.852
[growls]

00:15.105 --> 00:16.148
[grunts]

00:19.025 --> 00:20.068
[scoffs]

00:28.160 --> 00:29.411
[MAN] The Heavy Knight.

00:30.371 --> 00:34.082
A densely armored class
that specializes in defense

00:34.124 --> 00:37.043
and draws enemy attacks
to protect allies.

00:38.671 --> 00:42.257
But, compared to the many
other defensive classes,

00:42.299 --> 00:43.885
it lacks versatility.

00:44.969 --> 00:46.846
With its weak
offensive abilities,

00:47.346 --> 00:50.140
leveling up
is almost impossible.

00:53.143 --> 00:54.144
As a result...

00:55.103 --> 00:57.314
...it's considered to be
a truly unfortunate

00:57.356 --> 00:58.900
and defective class.

00:58.941 --> 00:59.942
[girl chuckles]

01:01.276 --> 01:02.319
[chuckles]

01:03.779 --> 01:06.407
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:35.830 --> 02:37.539
[thunder cracks]

02:37.915 --> 02:40.126
[boy panting]

02:42.294 --> 02:43.211
[grunts]

02:43.629 --> 02:45.380
[♪ mysterious music playing]

02:47.633 --> 02:49.551
[MAN]
Regardless of what it might be,

02:49.969 --> 02:51.053
every time I've learned

02:51.095 --> 02:53.014
- or seen something here...
- Huh?

02:53.055 --> 02:55.432
- [footsteps approaching]
- Huh.

02:57.018 --> 02:59.394
[grunts, gasps]

03:00.062 --> 03:03.065
[MAN]...I've always had
this inexplicable feeling

03:03.482 --> 03:05.400
that I already knew what it was.

03:06.694 --> 03:10.405
[BOY] Somehow, it seems like
I've seen all of this before.

03:10.823 --> 03:11.866
Huh?

03:13.075 --> 03:14.535
[gasps]

03:19.581 --> 03:21.000
[whooshing]

03:21.917 --> 03:22.960
[MAN 1] Huh?

03:25.379 --> 03:26.588
- [spider screeches]
- [man 1 grunts]

03:26.630 --> 03:28.507
[♪ rock music playing]

03:30.009 --> 03:32.136
- [man 2 grunts]
- [sword slashes]

03:32.803 --> 03:34.346
- [man 2 grunts]
- [sword slashes]

03:34.388 --> 03:37.141
- [monster growls]
- [grunts]

03:37.641 --> 03:39.894
- [monster roars]
- [yells]

03:45.231 --> 03:47.275
- [spider screeches]
- [man 2 grunting]

03:48.944 --> 03:50.154
[grunts]

03:50.196 --> 03:52.031
[yells]

03:55.076 --> 03:56.994
[grunting]

03:57.036 --> 03:58.453
[panting]

04:04.668 --> 04:06.503
[chuckles]

04:06.962 --> 04:08.296
[GIRL] Doppellusion!

04:08.338 --> 04:09.339
[woman laughs]

04:09.840 --> 04:13.094
Time to show you what a true
Master Swordsman can do!

04:13.468 --> 04:16.597
[grunts] Cold-As-Steel Cutter!

04:17.263 --> 04:19.892
- [woman grunts]
- [man 2 strains]

04:19.934 --> 04:21.643
- [both grunting]
- [swords clashing]

04:25.940 --> 04:27.775
[grunting]

04:31.653 --> 04:33.114
- [both grunts]
- [swords clash]

04:33.822 --> 04:35.116
[both grunts]

04:35.490 --> 04:37.409
- [laughs smugly]
- [man 1 grunts]

04:39.411 --> 04:40.955
- [woman laughs evilly]
- [gasps]

04:40.996 --> 04:42.957
[yells]

04:44.708 --> 04:46.710
- [monster growls]
- [grunts]

04:48.754 --> 04:50.380
- [grunts]
- [sword slashes]

04:50.422 --> 04:53.050
[man 3 yells]

04:53.092 --> 04:54.509
[monster groans]

04:54.551 --> 04:56.262
[grunts]

04:57.429 --> 04:58.597
[spider screeches]

04:58.639 --> 05:00.306
- [man 1 screams fiercely]
- [man 2 grunts]

05:06.354 --> 05:07.564
[MAN] And today...

05:09.108 --> 05:11.193
as heir to the Edvaughn family,

05:11.735 --> 05:15.030
I'm about to undertake
the Ritual of Divine Blessing.

05:15.072 --> 05:16.573
[crowd murmuring]

05:18.951 --> 05:22.037
There's that peculiar feeling
of déjàà vu again.

05:23.289 --> 05:25.249
It's all right, my son.

05:25.291 --> 05:26.667
You must have faith.

05:26.708 --> 05:28.710
Trust in the God of the Sword.

05:28.752 --> 05:30.796
♪

05:30.838 --> 05:31.880
[breathes shakily]

05:33.174 --> 05:34.216
[sighs]

05:36.010 --> 05:38.053
Now, Elymas Edvaughn...

05:44.143 --> 05:48.147
I grant you the divine blessing
of a class.

05:48.189 --> 05:50.232
Mm. Baptisma!

05:52.693 --> 05:54.195
[ELYMAS] I've seen this.

05:54.236 --> 05:56.155
Was it five years ago?

05:56.197 --> 05:57.823
No, before that.

05:57.906 --> 06:00.659
Long before I'd even been born.

06:01.243 --> 06:02.203
[gasps]

06:02.911 --> 06:05.580
I was addicted
to an online VR game

06:05.622 --> 06:07.291
called Magic World,

06:07.333 --> 06:09.293
and played it obsessively.
[gasps]

06:09.335 --> 06:12.462
Yet the world I'm in now
is exactly like it!

06:12.504 --> 06:16.382
It's hard to believe,
but I've been reincarnated.

06:16.424 --> 06:18.635
With everything I know
about the game,

06:18.677 --> 06:20.929
I'm guaranteed
to be a success here.

06:20.971 --> 06:22.806
[grunts]
And with this advantage,

06:22.848 --> 06:26.101
I hope I'm put
into my favorite class.

06:27.769 --> 06:30.356
The broken one that's said
to be the strongest

06:30.396 --> 06:31.773
in all of Magic World.

06:35.819 --> 06:37.071
[gasps]

06:37.279 --> 06:38.322
[gasps]

06:46.121 --> 06:47.373
[ELYMAS] All right!

06:47.413 --> 06:48.374
[gasps happily]

06:48.749 --> 06:51.293
I'm a Heavy Knight, Father.
I did it!

06:51.793 --> 06:53.795
[Elymas's father gasps]
You're-- You're what?!

06:54.296 --> 06:55.463
- Father?
- [crowd chattering]

06:56.173 --> 06:57.883
My son? No!

06:57.925 --> 07:01.136
You are a Master Swordsman, right?

07:01.178 --> 07:02.179
[Elymas gasps]

07:02.596 --> 07:04.681
- [crowd whispering]
- [gasps]

07:04.723 --> 07:07.809
[splutters]

07:07.851 --> 07:09.853
[Elymas gasps] My past
and present memories

07:09.895 --> 07:10.979
have been mixed up!

07:11.355 --> 07:12.398
In this world,

07:12.814 --> 07:15.067
simple and powerful classes
are widely celebrated.

07:15.109 --> 07:17.443
But those that take time
are sold short.

07:18.695 --> 07:20.906
Their analysis
and testing of classes

07:20.948 --> 07:22.824
must be severely
lagging behind.

07:23.825 --> 07:25.577
- [ELYMAS] Uh, actually, I--
- [woman gasps]

07:25.619 --> 07:27.204
[ELYMAS'S FATHER] Show me!

07:27.746 --> 07:28.872
[gasps]

07:28.914 --> 07:30.707
So it is true!

07:30.749 --> 07:31.959
- How could this be?
- [gasps]

07:32.167 --> 07:34.836
With such low stats
and no decent attacking skills,

07:34.878 --> 07:37.172
being a Heavy Knight
is utterly worthless!

07:37.672 --> 07:39.383
Everyone knows it's a pitiful,

07:39.425 --> 07:41.969
- defective class!
- But that simply isn't true!

07:42.010 --> 07:43.929
They have the highest HP
and Defense, Father.

07:43.971 --> 07:46.307
That's irrelevant,
just as you are!

07:46.348 --> 07:48.309
- [grunts]
- [crowd gasps]

07:50.476 --> 07:52.813
- [crowd chattering]
- [MAN] Oh!

07:52.854 --> 07:54.231
[gasps]

07:54.273 --> 07:57.109
- [Elymas groaning]
- [spits]

07:57.151 --> 07:58.484
I'm glad it was here.

07:58.526 --> 08:01.029
If we'd been shamed like this
out in public,

08:01.071 --> 08:02.739
the Edvaughn name
would be ruined.

08:02.781 --> 08:04.241
[groans]

08:08.787 --> 08:10.247
- [gasps]
- [footsteps approaching]

08:10.289 --> 08:12.249
[all gasp]

08:14.751 --> 08:16.837
[♪ ethereal music playing]

08:21.008 --> 08:23.509
- [Elymas's father gasps]
- [crowd whispering]

08:24.970 --> 08:26.305
[WOMAN 1] Look at her.

08:26.347 --> 08:28.432
[WOMAN 2]
She looks so beautiful now.

08:28.932 --> 08:31.185
- [MAN 1] Who's that?
- [MAN 2] So lovely.

08:32.102 --> 08:33.479
[MAN 3] The daughter
of a branch family?

08:33.687 --> 08:35.439
- [MAN 4] Do you have any idea?
- [MAN 3] Are you certain?

08:35.481 --> 08:37.065
[whispers continue]

08:41.153 --> 08:42.321
[gasps]

08:43.738 --> 08:45.199
[WOMAN] I'm supposed
to go through

08:45.240 --> 08:47.659
the Ritual of Divine Blessing
as well.

08:47.701 --> 08:48.910
May I do so?

08:49.119 --> 08:51.079
[WOMAN 3] Someone like this
ought to know her place.

08:51.121 --> 08:54.291
[ELYMAS] She's the daughter
of an Edvaughn branch family,

08:54.333 --> 08:56.043
and her name is Malice.

08:56.502 --> 08:59.463
We played together a few times
as children,

08:59.505 --> 09:01.715
- but because of her status...
- [MAN 5] She's grown up.

09:01.756 --> 09:04.759
...we've hardly spoken at all
these last five years.

09:06.970 --> 09:09.639
[PRIEST] Uh,
but I couldn't possibly!

09:09.681 --> 09:10.974
[ELYMAS'S FATHER]
I will allow it.

09:11.016 --> 09:12.767
You may begin the ritual.

09:14.353 --> 09:15.770
[MALICE] Mm.

09:19.107 --> 09:21.276
[ELYMAS]
Something feels off about this.

09:29.743 --> 09:31.537
Mm. Baptisma!

09:49.054 --> 09:50.097
[ELYMAS'S FATHER] Hmm.

09:55.310 --> 09:56.353
[sighs]

09:57.771 --> 09:58.813
[MALICE] Hmm?

10:02.359 --> 10:05.279
So, I'm a Master Swordsman, huh?

10:05.320 --> 10:07.197
[crowd whispering]

10:07.239 --> 10:08.365
[sighs]

10:08.407 --> 10:09.741
Hmm.

10:10.825 --> 10:12.578
I'm sorry.

10:13.537 --> 10:15.997
But regrettably,
it seems I'm the one

10:16.039 --> 10:17.999
who's taken all the skill.

10:18.041 --> 10:20.294
[ELYMAS]
My bad feelings were justified.

10:21.295 --> 10:22.670
A branch family's daughter

10:22.712 --> 10:24.756
acquiring
the Master Swordsman class

10:24.798 --> 10:26.925
could worsen
my father's terrible mood.

10:26.967 --> 10:28.427
[thunder rumbling]

10:28.469 --> 10:31.221
[gasps in shock, laughs]

10:31.263 --> 10:33.140
[ELYMAS'S FATHER]
How wonderful, Malice!

10:33.181 --> 10:35.683
I always knew
you were a true Edvaughn.

10:35.934 --> 10:37.269
As of this very moment,

10:37.311 --> 10:39.563
- you are officially my daughter.
- [gasps]

10:39.605 --> 10:41.898
And you will be my heir.

10:42.399 --> 10:43.442
[gasps sharply]

10:43.942 --> 10:45.819
[MAN 6] He actually named
a branch family girl

10:45.860 --> 10:46.903
as his heir?

10:46.945 --> 10:48.863
[MAN 7]
It isn't without precedent.

10:48.905 --> 10:50.449
[crowd whispering]

10:50.491 --> 10:55.370
Father, I always thought
Lord Elymas-- No.

10:56.580 --> 10:58.415
That Elymas could never bear

10:58.457 --> 11:00.875
the burden
of being your true heir.

11:00.917 --> 11:02.210
- [laughs evilly]
- [gasps]

11:02.252 --> 11:04.212
[ELYMAS'S FATHER]
Begone, Elymas.

11:04.712 --> 11:08.258
A disappointment like you
must never call himself my son!

11:08.300 --> 11:09.675
- [Elymas gasps]
- As a Heavy Knight,

11:09.717 --> 11:12.137
you've sullied
the Edvaughn family name!

11:12.638 --> 11:15.265
- So leave this mansion at once!
- [gasps]

11:15.974 --> 11:16.891
[gasps]

11:16.933 --> 11:19.436
[crowds chattering]

11:19.936 --> 11:21.980
[WOMAN 4] He's adopting
a branch family girl?

11:22.022 --> 11:23.106
- [Elymas gasps]
- [MAN 8] I suppose

11:23.148 --> 11:24.232
it can't be helped
at this point.

11:24.274 --> 11:25.275
[WOMAN 5] He made a wise choice.

11:25.317 --> 11:26.901
Surely you don't mean that,
Father!

11:28.153 --> 11:29.821
Heavy Knights are powerful.

11:29.863 --> 11:31.739
I-I swear. I'll bring honor to--

11:31.781 --> 11:33.283
- [ELYMAS'S FATHER] Silence!
- [winces]

11:33.741 --> 11:35.910
You're getting exactly
what you deserve.

11:35.952 --> 11:37.538
Don't show your face here again.

11:37.579 --> 11:39.080
- [gasps]
- If you ever use

11:39.122 --> 11:41.458
the Edvaughn family name
outside of these walls,

11:41.500 --> 11:44.670
I'll have your head
for such insolence!

11:45.212 --> 11:46.672
[chuckles maliciously]

11:47.088 --> 11:48.215
[gasps]

11:48.882 --> 11:49.966
[gasps]

11:51.635 --> 11:53.220
- [scoffs]
- [ELYMAS] Father!

11:54.012 --> 11:55.013
[gasps]

11:55.556 --> 11:56.598
[Malice chuckles softly]

11:57.641 --> 11:59.017
[ELYMAS'S FATHER] Clean this up.

12:00.561 --> 12:01.769
[chuckles]

12:03.438 --> 12:05.982
[gasps in disbelief]

12:06.732 --> 12:07.859
[thunder crashing]

12:21.707 --> 12:24.084
[ELYMAS] No matter how much
I pleaded with him,

12:24.125 --> 12:25.919
my father refused to listen.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.879
- [BUTLER] Be safe out there.
- I was given a small bag

12:27.921 --> 12:29.381
- with a few coins...
- Thank you.

12:29.423 --> 12:31.633
...then left
after being kicked out

12:31.675 --> 12:33.009
of the mansion that day.

12:34.802 --> 12:35.845
[sighs]

12:44.563 --> 12:45.647
[chuckles]

12:47.190 --> 12:48.316
[thunder cracks]

12:56.824 --> 12:58.577
[♪ bright music playing]

13:11.548 --> 13:13.007
[crowd chattering at distance]

13:22.559 --> 13:24.978
[SOLDIER] Should we recruit
party members too?

13:25.771 --> 13:27.063
Anybody will do,
as long as they're fast.

13:27.105 --> 13:30.317
[indistinct chatter]

13:30.358 --> 13:31.526
[chuckles softly]

13:32.235 --> 13:33.361
[MAN 1] So, how have you been?

13:33.903 --> 13:35.656
[MAN IN RED] Well, actually,
I'm planning to take on

13:35.697 --> 13:37.324
- a promotion quest soon.
- [all gasp]

13:37.365 --> 13:39.159
I've got some pull
with the examiners.

13:39.200 --> 13:41.536
- [MAN 2] Wow!
- Lord Teal's amazing!

13:41.995 --> 13:43.871
[giggles]

13:45.248 --> 13:49.085
Today's the day, you two!
I'm ready to do my best!

13:49.127 --> 13:51.379
- Whoop! Yeah!
- [man sighs]

13:51.421 --> 13:53.839
Just try not to get in the way
this time.

13:53.881 --> 13:55.300
- [girl groans]
- I wish at least once

13:55.342 --> 13:56.760
- you would just hunt normally.
- [woman sighs]

13:57.218 --> 13:59.346
[yawns]

13:59.387 --> 14:00.722
[whimpers]

14:01.473 --> 14:02.766
[sighs]

14:04.100 --> 14:05.393
[indistinct chatter]

14:10.023 --> 14:11.899
[WOMAN 1] My husband's fine
in public,

14:11.941 --> 14:14.778
but at home, he's so simple.

14:14.820 --> 14:15.903
[WOMAN 2] That's just men.

14:15.945 --> 14:17.781
I mean,
what were you expecting?

14:17.823 --> 14:19.825
[birds chirping]

14:20.325 --> 14:22.786
[ELYMAS] My piece-of-shit father
put me through hell.

14:23.662 --> 14:27.415
I lost my family, home,
and the life I knew.

14:27.999 --> 14:28.958
But...

14:29.417 --> 14:31.795
I've still got
the strongest class,

14:32.128 --> 14:33.254
Heavy Knight!

14:37.634 --> 14:38.884
That said,

14:38.926 --> 14:41.095
the history of this world?

14:41.137 --> 14:43.431
Even Rondalm, the city's name.

14:44.015 --> 14:45.933
They're different
from the game I played.

14:47.477 --> 14:50.564
Which means
I'll need to do some research.

14:52.607 --> 14:55.819
First,
I'll test my class and skills.

14:55.861 --> 14:57.070
Display stats.

14:58.904 --> 15:00.240
If everything's been changed

15:00.323 --> 15:02.784
and Heavy Knights aren't
as overpowered as they were,

15:03.117 --> 15:04.452
then I'm screwed.

15:05.453 --> 15:06.454
[gasps]

15:07.913 --> 15:09.583
Great. Still good.

15:10.625 --> 15:11.877
The skill tree.

15:11.917 --> 15:13.336
This is what lets people choose

15:13.378 --> 15:16.130
which types of skills they want
for a given situation.

15:17.465 --> 15:20.802
At the moment,
I only have five skill points.

15:20.844 --> 15:22.345
These are the bonus ones
you receive

15:22.387 --> 15:23.971
after gaining your class.

15:24.930 --> 15:28.393
After that, you gain one
per level as you advance.

15:29.935 --> 15:31.646
It's no exaggeration to say

15:31.688 --> 15:33.939
how they're assigned
can determine your fate.

15:34.900 --> 15:36.860
There are two types of skills.

15:36.902 --> 15:39.320
Those determined by class
are Fixed Skills,

15:39.362 --> 15:41.947
and some are randomly assigned
at the start.

15:42.824 --> 15:44.033
Oath of the Heavy Armor

15:44.075 --> 15:45.827
is the only fixed class
skill tree.

15:45.869 --> 15:47.036
[onlookers laughing]

15:47.078 --> 15:48.914
Of all the ones
given to Heavy Knights,

15:48.954 --> 15:52.417
people often refer to it
as the weakest and least useful.

15:53.042 --> 15:54.960
Although it can be
fairly strong,

15:55.420 --> 15:56.922
it isn't easy to use,

15:57.338 --> 16:00.300
and many of its skills
have very limited applications.

16:01.217 --> 16:02.343
On the other hand,

16:02.385 --> 16:04.387
Defense Booster
is a useful skill tree.

16:04.805 --> 16:08.308
Instead of adding an ability,
it increases defense.

16:09.350 --> 16:11.645
Beginner Swordsmanship's
good too.

16:11.686 --> 16:13.062
When maxed out, it can evolve

16:13.187 --> 16:16.650
into the Advanced Swordsmanship
tree with special items.

16:17.066 --> 16:18.151
[chuckles softly]

16:18.192 --> 16:19.653
That said...

16:23.907 --> 16:24.908
[gasps]

16:25.617 --> 16:26.952
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Oath of the Heavy Armor

16:26.992 --> 16:28.662
has reached Level Two.

16:28.703 --> 16:31.414
Rampart Reflection skill
has been acquired.

16:31.997 --> 16:35.000
Oath of the Heavy Armor
has reached Level Five.

16:35.042 --> 16:37.545
Defense has increased by 10.

16:38.254 --> 16:39.589
[ELYMAS] All right.

16:39.631 --> 16:41.967
[grunts] That'll work.

16:44.886 --> 16:47.138
[birds chirping]

16:50.015 --> 16:51.601
♪

16:52.686 --> 16:54.228
[cape rustling]

17:19.212 --> 17:20.588
[gasps]

17:35.228 --> 17:36.229
[gasps]

17:36.813 --> 17:39.148
- [leaves rustling]
- [birds chirping]

17:40.316 --> 17:41.943
[leaves rustling]

17:41.985 --> 17:44.362
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

17:47.824 --> 17:49.325
- [croaks]
- [gasps]

17:52.746 --> 17:54.915
[croaking]

17:58.001 --> 18:01.128
A Raana? Display stats.

18:05.592 --> 18:07.468
- [Raana croaks]
- [gasps]

18:08.261 --> 18:11.347
[ELYMAS] You don't waste time.
Bring it!

18:13.391 --> 18:14.893
- [Raana croaks]
- [grunts]

18:15.393 --> 18:16.436
Rampart Reflection!

18:17.812 --> 18:19.104
[groans]

18:23.192 --> 18:24.485
[cape rustling]

18:27.864 --> 18:29.198
[sighs]

18:31.910 --> 18:33.118
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level Two has been reached.

18:33.160 --> 18:34.161
[ELYMAS] Well.

18:34.913 --> 18:37.791
I had no idea
it would be this disgusting.

18:37.832 --> 18:40.418
[AUTOMATED VOICE] When an enemy
melee attack is negated,

18:40.460 --> 18:43.337
deal damage equal
to the user's Defense.

18:44.171 --> 18:45.381
[birds chirping]

18:53.098 --> 18:54.891
[ELYMAS]
A Level Two Magic Stone.

18:55.308 --> 18:57.894
It's not worth much,
but I'll take it.

18:57.936 --> 19:00.438
- [man yelling in panic]
- [gasps]

19:02.565 --> 19:05.401
[MAN] Someone. Help me, please!

19:05.443 --> 19:07.403
[gasps, grunts]

19:08.655 --> 19:09.823
[yells]

19:10.615 --> 19:14.535
[yelling]
They're gonna kill me!

19:15.078 --> 19:16.537
- Who are you?
- [gasps]

19:17.038 --> 19:18.581
Please. You have to help me!

19:18.957 --> 19:20.083
- Huh?
- [Raanas croaking]

19:20.125 --> 19:21.126
- [yells]
- [Elymas gasps]

19:21.166 --> 19:23.128
[croaking]

19:23.168 --> 19:25.046
[screams]

19:25.505 --> 19:28.173
- [croaking]
- [man gasps]

19:28.716 --> 19:30.551
[whimpering]

19:30.593 --> 19:32.095
- Stand back.
- Huh?

19:32.595 --> 19:35.306
Ah!
Can you really take them down?

19:35.932 --> 19:37.809
[gasps] Even though
you don't look the part,

19:37.851 --> 19:40.227
are you actually
a famous adventurer?

19:41.062 --> 19:42.480
[ELYMAS] No.

19:42.939 --> 19:44.107
Huh?!

19:45.900 --> 19:48.528
In fact, I just leveled up
for the first time

19:48.569 --> 19:49.529
in my whole life.

19:49.570 --> 19:52.573
So you're hopeless?!

19:52.615 --> 19:55.076
Stop! Come back!
You're too weak!

19:55.702 --> 19:56.828
I'm much stronger than you

19:56.870 --> 19:59.122
and I can't handle
that many monsters!

19:59.164 --> 20:01.415
Now take off that heavy armor!

20:01.457 --> 20:03.543
We have to run!

20:04.335 --> 20:06.462
[ELYMAS] Rampart Reflection
isn't perfect.

20:07.505 --> 20:10.133
My defense needs to be greater
than my opponent's attack

20:10.175 --> 20:11.592
to negate all damage.

20:12.135 --> 20:15.638
If my defense is lower,
then it won't even activate.

20:19.433 --> 20:20.852
Run away!

20:20.894 --> 20:22.937
- [croaks]
- [squeals]

20:24.229 --> 20:27.192
[ELYMAS] It's useless against
superior and unknown foes.

20:27.650 --> 20:29.194
- [croaking]
- But still...

20:29.234 --> 20:32.155
Let's go. Rampart Reflection!

20:32.363 --> 20:34.074
[grunts]

20:34.115 --> 20:35.616
Huh?

20:40.997 --> 20:43.624
[ELYMAS] I'm already familiar
with these starter enemies.

20:44.042 --> 20:45.626
And I've boosted my defense

20:45.668 --> 20:47.837
with skill tree bonuses
and equipment.

20:49.547 --> 20:50.840
When it comes to Raana,

20:50.882 --> 20:53.134
I can beat dozens of them.

20:53.176 --> 20:54.510
No problem!

20:54.969 --> 20:57.680
- [grunts]
- [Raanas groaning]

20:58.389 --> 20:59.724
[gasps in disbelief]

20:59.766 --> 21:01.350
[cape rustling]

21:04.812 --> 21:06.271
[splutters]

21:07.481 --> 21:09.234
You brought down that many?

21:09.692 --> 21:12.277
Wait. Who are you?

21:13.780 --> 21:15.990
The name's Elymas Ed--

21:16.032 --> 21:18.159
If you ever use
the Edvaughn family name

21:18.201 --> 21:19.994
outside of these walls,

21:20.036 --> 21:22.538
I'll have your head
for such insolence!

21:22.914 --> 21:24.373
I'm so sorry.

21:24.415 --> 21:25.499
[huffs irritably]

21:27.627 --> 21:29.212
[gasps] Hmm?

21:29.254 --> 21:30.295
[ELYMAS] No.

21:30.337 --> 21:32.465
[♪ dramatic music playing]

21:34.092 --> 21:35.300
The Heavy Knight,

21:36.385 --> 21:37.428
Elymas.

21:40.765 --> 21:42.934
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:11.356 --> 23:13.858
[ELYMAS] I've won my very first
battle after being assigned

23:13.900 --> 23:15.526
the Heavy Knight class.

23:15.568 --> 23:18.821
And fortunately for me,
just like in the VR game,

23:18.863 --> 23:20.365
it's still
the most powerful one.

23:20.865 --> 23:23.784
But I still need to level up
to reach my full potential.

23:24.369 --> 23:26.537
I don't have any time
to waste out here.

23:26.579 --> 23:28.789
But at the moment,
a horrible monster

23:28.831 --> 23:31.209
appears before me
that's double my level.

23:33.044 --> 23:36.297
Next time, "The Menacing
Foul Eight-Legged Beast."

23:36.339 --> 23:38.216
This battle isn't unwinnable!
